                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]Note: The Developer provided me with a key for this game.[/h1]\n\nFur Up is a cute, relaxing little arcade scorer, where you endlessly jump from platform to platform and try to survive. \n\n[h1]Pros:[/h1]\n[list]\n[*] Relaxing visuals and music.\n[*] Quite challenging to keep going a long time.\n[*] Excellent little time waster.\n[*] Has potential for a fun little party game - with multiplayer.\n[*] Global and Friends leaderboards.\n[*] Low cost.\n[/list]\n\n[h1]Cons:[/h1]\n[list]\n[*] It's quite similar to other games in this genre.\n[*] There are only two powerups and one type of bouncy platform - I felt there could be more.\n[*] Online multiplayer is a cool idea but there is no playerbase to challenge so you'll need to bring your own friends.\n[/list]\n\nI've shared my first 15 minutes in a video which really showcases everything the game has to offer - other than getting a higher score, of course!\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8SbykQZbHrU\n\nIt's a game that has limited scope but still has some charm. If you're interested in a cheap relaxing time waster then I'm happy to recommend it, but the only reason I'll personally play it again, is if a friend challenges me... so bring it on!\n\n♥♥♥ If you find my reviews interesting, please follow  [url=http://store.steampowered.com/curator/28971565/]My Curator Page[/url]. Thanks! ♥♥♥",
